---
module: mount_facts
version_added: 2.18
short_description: Retrieve filesystem mount facts from POSIX hosts
description:
  - Retrieves mount information from static and dynamic sources on POSIX hosts.
options:
  sources:
    description:
      - Sources to read mount information from. Accepts C(all), C(static), C(dynamic), a file path, or C(mount).
    type: list
